<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.5 </span>unfaithful cot example from <span id="Ax3.SS5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">FINE-CoT</span></h3>

