<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>The Use of Large Language Models </h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We employed OpenAI GPT-5 solely as a tool for language refinement. Its use was limited to proofreading, grammar correction, and stylistic adjustments, comparable to the functions of conventional grammar checkers or dictionaries. The tool did not generate any new scientific content or ideas, and its application aligns with common practices in manuscript preparation.</p>
</div>
